\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces On-time delivery does not guarantee continued availability. Two actual c16-overload runs process the same complete 12--14-s audio interval using their own ready clocks. (a) Computation-only displays 37 new code points at 1.444~s, withdraws the supported view at 1.544~s and restores identical text at 3.720~s. (b) RevTrace first displays the same whole text at 2.027~s, missing D2 by 27.4~ms, and keeps the interval covered thereafter. Its 3.794-s selected update retains an ahead 16-s view. The dotted line marks D2 (2~s); both certified deliveries meet C8 (8~s). These are separate executions with different interleavings, rather than an event-matched counterfactual.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:continuity_case}{{1}{2}{On-time delivery does not guarantee continued availability. Two actual c16-overload runs process the same complete 12--14-s audio interval using their own ready clocks. (a) Computation-only displays 37 new code points at 1.444~s, withdraws the supported view at 1.544~s and restores identical text at 3.720~s. (b) RevTrace first displays the same whole text at 2.027~s, missing D2 by 27.4~ms, and keeps the interval covered thereafter. Its 3.794-s selected update retains an ahead 16-s view. The dotted line marks D2 (2~s); both certified deliveries meet C8 (8~s). These are separate executions with different interleavings, rather than an event-matched counterfactual}{figure.1}{}}
