\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Early execution and later confirmation meet at selection. The input packet binds audio, target/EOS, full state and model/decoder configuration. Original call $j_3$ already runs; its result may complete before or after [EL] confirms the actual parent. [AU] joins that complete result, confirmed current parent and owned identity; synchronizing fact $D$ precedes installation. [SUP] independently checks the whole visible view. Numbers identify distinct facts: parent $P_2$ (1) and child $P_3$ (2). The Consumer lane shows application of (1); (2) triggers its own [SUP] check when applied. Pending input permits running/buffering without commit. Solid arrows carry data/state; dashed arrows carry check evidence. Icons and modules are schematic, without a measured time scale.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:protocol}{{2}{3}{Early execution and later confirmation meet at selection. The input packet binds audio, target/EOS, full state and model/decoder configuration. Original call $j_3$ already runs; its result may complete before or after [EL] confirms the actual parent. [AU] joins that complete result, confirmed current parent and owned identity; synchronizing fact $D$ precedes installation. [SUP] independently checks the whole visible view. Numbers identify distinct facts: parent $P_2$ (1) and child $P_3$ (2). The Consumer lane shows application of (1); (2) triggers its own [SUP] check when applied. Pending input permits running/buffering without commit. Solid arrows carry data/state; dashed arrows carry check evidence. Icons and modules are schematic, without a measured time scale}{figure.2}{}}
