\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Computation and view retention have different service effects. Each point pools three eight-speaker cohorts in the predeclared Qwen, $\rho =1$, staggered stratum; each arm offers 714.110~s. Lines compare the two computation-retention settings, separately for view retention off/on. (a) Total frontier withdrawals. (b) Offered-audio fraction meeting both display 2~s and certified 8~s deadlines. The joint point is RevTrace. All four arms and the separate Alternative joint positive control fail whole-run D2 (15 runs total).}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:main_evidence}{{3}{8}{Computation and view retention have different service effects. Each point pools three eight-speaker cohorts in the predeclared Qwen, $\rho =1$, staggered stratum; each arm offers 714.110~s. Lines compare the two computation-retention settings, separately for view retention off/on. (a) Total frontier withdrawals. (b) Offered-audio fraction meeting both display 2~s and certified 8~s deadlines. The joint point is RevTrace. All four arms and the separate Alternative joint positive control fail whole-run D2 (15 runs total)}{figure.3}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces More matching content meets both deadlines. Each bank/policy offers 66.340~audio-s from four existing speakers. Stacks partition timely coverage matching later selected whole text at its own frontier, other timely coverage, and missed deadlines. Agreement is retrospective, distinct from online [SUP] and human accuracy. Both timely categories may be legal provisional views. Labels are rounded percentages; trial/request pass counts are reported separately.}}{8}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:native_content}{{4}{8}{More matching content meets both deadlines. Each bank/policy offers 66.340~audio-s from four existing speakers. Stacks partition timely coverage matching later selected whole text at its own frontier, other timely coverage, and missed deadlines. Agreement is retrospective, distinct from online [SUP] and human accuracy. Both timely categories may be legal provisional views. Labels are rounded percentages; trial/request pass counts are reported separately}{figure.4}{}}
