\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {IV}{\ignorespaces Fault containment preserves legality; cold recovery still misses the original service deadlines. The 24 short trials all finish with zero illegal installations. Each row covers two fresh trials on the same clip; RevTrace uses input-confirmed full calls. Rejected messages cause zero selected-state mutations ($\Delta C$). Ranges are observed minima/maxima. New result measures fault to actual certified consumption of a new fact whose call completes after the fault, separately from old-fact replay and replacement readiness. Pass counts joint whole-run D2/C8; EOS counts D2 misses. Both-board energy runs through physical drain.}}{10}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:native_reliability}{{IV}{10}{Fault containment preserves legality; cold recovery still misses the original service deadlines. The 24 short trials all finish with zero illegal installations. Each row covers two fresh trials on the same clip; RevTrace uses input-confirmed full calls. Rejected messages cause zero selected-state mutations ($\Delta C$). Ranges are observed minima/maxima. New result measures fault to actual certified consumption of a new fact whose call completes after the fault, separately from old-fact replay and replacement readiness. Pass counts joint whole-run D2/C8; EOS counts D2 misses. Both-board energy runs through physical drain}{table.4}{}}
